<code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">pathAnim.beginTime</code> is duration * 0.2, meaning the end transition only starts at the point where the previous animation finishes, and the remaining transition duration is duration * 0.8. In this way, the two animations that are connected are executed, and finally the animations are added to the animation group, then added to the layer.</p>

